      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FANCY FAYE (1) was popular in betting last start but disappointed when 10 lengths away in sixth (20.96). Was in the money the start prior. Has ability and looks hard to stop. WOODSIDE WOMBAT (3) hit the ground running last time with a fast early split and never headed, leading throughout to win by one length (20.16) over 350m at this track. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Must be included in calculations. PETITE BEAST (7) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Warragul behind Paw Rex (23.31) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Will give a great sight again.",
